msgid "email accounts will be deleted, but the messages remain on disk."
msgstr "ບັນຊີອີເມລຈະຖືກລຶບ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນດິສກ໌."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/domains/delete.html:64
msgid "DNS zone with all its records will be permanently deleted."
msgstr "DNS zone ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກທັງໝົດຈະຖືກລຶບຢ່າງຖາວອນ."

