msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:281
msgid ""
"Startup file is the main entry point of the application, usually app.py or "
"app.js file."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼັກຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ app.py "
"ຫຼື app.js."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:306
msgid "Custom startup command"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:324
#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:348
msgid "Git repository URL"
msgstr "URL ຂອງ Git repository"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:330
msgid "Startup command"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:337
msgid ""
"If custom startup command is provided, it will be executed instead of the "
"default"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີການລະບຸຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເອງ, ມັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:354
msgid ""
"Optional. If set, the app's code is fetched from this repository and reset "
"to its latest commit every time the container starts, before install/startup"
" runs."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໂຄ້ດຂອງແອັບຈະຖືກດຶງຈາກ repository ນີ້ແລະຣີເຊັດໄປຫາ "
"commit ຫຼ້າສຸດທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ container ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຕິດຕັ້ງ/ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:359
msgid ""
"Only https:// URLs are supported, and only public repositories - for a "
"private repo, generate a personal access token and embed it in the URL, e.g."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ URL ແບບ https:// ແລະສະເພາະ repository ສາທາລະນະເທົ່ານັ້ນ - ສຳລັບ"
" repo ສ່ວນຕົວ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ personal access token ແລະຝັງມັນໃນ URL, ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:382
msgid "Owner account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີເຈົ້າຂອງ"

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/app_install.html:384
msgid ""
"Creates n8n's first (owner) account automatically, so you land straight on "
"the login screen instead of n8n's own setup wizard."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງບັນຊີທຳອິດ (ເຈົ້າຂອງ) ຂອງ n8n ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານໄປຮອດໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໂດຍກົງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຕົວຊ່ວຍຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ n8n."

