msgid "WordPress install started. Please wait for the process to finish."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ WordPress ແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຂະບວນການຈະສຳເລັດ."

#: openpanel/internal/web/templates/manager/wp/install.html:724
msgid ""
"Error fetching WordPress versions from WP.ORG API. Please refresh page."
msgstr ""
